    "updated_at": "2015-09-23T20:57:27Z",
    "body": "How is it not clear?\n\n> The clearTimeout() and clearInterval() methods must clear the entry identified as handle from the list of active timers of the WindowTimers object on which the method was invoked, if any, where handle is the argument passed to the method.\n\nThere's a single list of active timers.\n",
